ltime", "label": "Supabase Realtime Subsystem", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "lines 1415-1731", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "WebSocket subscription to postgres_changes on messages/contacts/leads. Designed around mobile PWA suspension: the OS kills the socket, so the app resyncs on visibilitychange only if the channel died or the app was hidden >10s (a short desktop blur/focus should NOT tear down a healthy channel and reload 500 rows). A 25s backup poll covers WebViews where the socket stays 'alive' but stops delivering events. Duplicate delivery is handled by id-based dedup plus reconciling optimistic local messages (no id) by txt+time."}, {"id": "index_startrealtime", "label": "startRealtime", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "lines 1421-1449", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_resyncrealtime", "label": "resyncRealtime", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "lines 1461-1481", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_startrealtimepoll", "label": "startRealtimePoll (Backup Polling)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "lines 1721-1731", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_handlerealtimemessage", "label": "handleRealtimeMessage", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "lines 1483-1556", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_handlerealtimecontact", "label": "handleRealtimeContact", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": "lines 1558-1574", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_handlerealtimelead", "label": "handleRealtimeLead", "file